    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-019-dan19:p004",
      "text": "初，澹從弟混與劉毅昵，澹常以爲憂，漸疏混，每謂弟璞、從子瞻曰：「益壽此性，終當破家。」混尋見誅，朝廷以澹先言，故不及禍。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "reviewed",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "c-nanshi-019-dan19:p004:m0002",
          "start": 2,
          "end": 3,
          "surface": "澹",
          "person_id": "ph1_0cf_nxw",
          "kind": "person",
          "status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "「初」回敘。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-nanshi-019-dan19:p004:m0005",
          "start": 5,
          "end": 6,
          "surface": "混",
          "person_id": "aa6_83c_juy_BAC",
          "kind": "person",
          "status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "澹之從弟，後文小字益壽。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-nanshi-019-dan19:p004:m0007",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 9,
          "surface": "劉毅",
          "person_id": "a59_2c3_a2e",
          "kind": "person",
          "status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "與謝混善，宋武帝時護軍劉毅，非西晉答武帝問孝者。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-nanshi-019-dan19:p004:m0011",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 12,
          "surface": "澹",
          "person_id": "ph1_0cf_nxw",
          "kind": "person",
          "status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "深憂者。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-nanshi-019-dan19:p004:m0019",
          "start": 19,
          "end": 20,
          "surface": "混",
          "person_id": "aa6_83c_juy_BAC",
          "kind": "person",
          "status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "澹漸疏之。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-nanshi-019-dan19:p004:m0024",
          "start": 24,
          "end": 25,
          "surface": "璞",
          "person_id": "aa6_83c_juy_B*A",
          "kind": "person",
          "status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "澹之弟，緊接有字景山附傳。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-nanshi-019-dan19:p004:m0028",
          "start": 28,
          "end": 29,
          "surface": "瞻",
          "person_id": "aa6_83c_juy_AAAD",
          "kind": "person",
          "status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "澹從子謝瞻。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-nanshi-019-dan19:p004:m0032",
          "start": 32,
          "end": 34,
          "surface": "益壽",
          "person_id": "aa6_83c_juy_BAC",
          "kind": "person",
          "status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "語中指混，《晉書》卷七十九明「益壽，混小字也」。"
        },
